{"seq":2,"slug":"execution-algorithms","title":"执行算法","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/algorithmic-trading/execution-algorithms","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"twap-vwap","title":"TWAP/VWAP 算法与变体","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/algorithmic-trading/execution-algorithms/twap-vwap","wordCount":1083,"readingTime":5},{"seq":2,"slug":"implementation-shortfall","title":"实施缺口与最优执行","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/algorithmic-trading/execution-algorithms/implementation-shortfall","wordCount":1238,"readingTime":5},{"seq":3,"slug":"smart-order-routing","title":"智能订单路由","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/algorithmic-trading/execution-algorithms/smart-order-routing","wordCount":981,"readingTime":4}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"执行算法\">执行算法</h1><p>执行算法（Execution Algorithms）解决的是&quot;如何将交易意图高效转化为市场订单&quot;的核心工程问题。当机构投资者需要买入或卖出大量资产时，直接下达市价单会造成显著的市场冲击，推高买入成本或压低卖出价格。执行算法将大额订单拆分为小单，按照特定的时间和价格策略分批执行。本章覆盖三大方向：TWAP/VWAP 等时间加权执行算法及其变体、基于实施缺口的最优执行理论、以及在多交易场所间分配订单的智能订单路由技术。这三个方向共同构成了从交易决策到市场成交的完整执行链条。</p>\n"}